Rule 6 (If the first dimension of input is zero, then the first dimension of shape must also be zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if shape(v_1, 0) = 0 then shape(v_2, 0) = 0
>>
Rule 7 (Shape tensor's elements must be non-negative)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 0) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 12 (If input tensor has a dimension of 1, the corresponding dimension in the shape tensor must be greater than or equal to 1 or padded with 1s on the left)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 0) - 1] : if i < ndim(v_1) then (if shape(v_1, i) = 1 then shape(v_2, i) ≥ 1 else shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)) else shape(v_2, i) = 1
