Rule 13 (If shape tensor's length is greater than input's ndim, pad input tensor's shape with ones on the left)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if shape(v_2, 0) > ndim(v_1) then ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_2, 0) - ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) = 1
